What this repository adds
-------------------------

Nothing that changes plugin behaviour. Specifically:

  * `dist/dsh-ops-0.3.0.tgz` — the output of upstream's own
    `node bin/dsh-ops.mjs build-ptc` followed by `npm pack`, run from upstream
    `main` at commit `857f917` (version 0.3.0). It differs from what upstream's
    own `npm pack` produces only in that the compiled native worker is present;
    upstream's `.gitignore` excludes `runtime/`, so their repository cannot
    carry it.

  * `install.ps1` / `install.sh` — installers that call the official DSH CLI
    and optionally flip the opt-in PTC component.

  * `README.md`, `checksums.txt`, this file.

No plugin source file was edited. Hashes are recorded in `checksums.txt` and
enforced by both installers.

